### Inventory (needs accessToken, storeId; set variantId from a product's variants[0].id)

@base = http://localhost:8080
@variantId = PASTE_VARIANT_ID

### Current level (created lazily with 0)
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/variants/{{variantId}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Receive stock
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/variants/{{variantId}}/inventory/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"delta": 25, "reason": "RECEIVED", "note": "PO-1042"}

### Write off damaged units (never below what is reserved → 409 stock_below_reserved)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/variants/{{variantId}}/inventory/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"delta": -2, "reason": "DAMAGED"}

### Ledger (newest first)
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/variants/{{variantId}}/inventory/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Stop tracking (always available on the storefront)
PATCH {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/variants/{{variantId}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tracked": false}
